{"step":9,"model":"deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash-0731","prompt":"","response":"The task is complete. I filled the Section Total cells (O4:O7) with formulas that correctly sum the point values across each row.\n\nThe issue was that the points columns (F, H, J, L, N) hold text values returned by the IF functions (e.g., `\"5\"`, `\"2\"`), so plain `=SUM` ignored them. I used:\n\n`=SUM(IFERROR(VALUE(F4),0), IFERROR(VALUE(H4),0), IFERROR(VALUE(J4),0), IFERROR(VALUE(L4),0), IFERROR(VALUE(N4),0))`\n\nThis coerces each text point to a number via `VALUE`, and `IFERROR(...,0)` handles empty cells so they don't produce `#VALUE!` errors. The results are:\n\n- O4 = 17 (5+2+4+3+3)\n- O5 = 7 (1+3+3)\n- O6 = 9 (1+5+1+2)\n- O7 = 6 (3+3)\n\nAll verified and submitted successfully.","input_tokens":83393,"output_tokens":239,"latency_ms":2905,"error":null}
